    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Earth with all you have!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to defend is by deploying the Celestials at your disposal. Strategically place them to block incoming threats and protect your civilization. Gather resources to enhance their power and equip them with a range of weapons to strengthen your defenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/52d96cf3df664912db07796953fadeb1.poster.avif?t=1748456071\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/52d96cf3df664912db07796953fadeb1.webm?t=1748456071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build powerful Celestials to defend Earth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tons of upgrade options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect Matter for permanent boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your orbit path strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock more content as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Survival modes for endless fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock new Celestials, powerful Augments, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover various Celestials with unique abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hit milestones to unlock even more content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/8d5c3b19fc2c2737d3adb3cccfc480d1.poster.avif?t=1748456071\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/8d5c3b19fc2c2737d3adb3cccfc480d1.webm?t=1748456071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Earth with all you have!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to defend is by deploying the Celestials at your disposal. Strategically place them to block incoming threats and protect your civilization. Gather resources to enhance their power and equip them with a range of weapons to strengthen your defenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/52d96cf3df664912db07796953fadeb1.poster.avif?t=1748456071\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/52d96cf3df664912db07796953fadeb1.webm?t=1748456071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build powerful Celestials to defend Earth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tons of upgrade options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect Matter for permanent boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your orbit path strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock more content as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Survival modes for endless fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock new Celestials, powerful Augments, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover various Celestials with unique abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hit milestones to unlock even more content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/8d5c3b19fc2c2737d3adb3cccfc480d1.poster.avif?t=1748456071\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772700/extras/8d5c3b19fc2c2737d3adb3cccfc480d1.webm?t=1748456071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
